1
00:00:00,476 --> 00:00:01,766
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

2
00:00:05,273 --> 00:00:08,863
Every Saturday since we've lived in
this apartment I have awakened at 6:15...

3
00:00:09,027 --> 00:00:11,697
...poured a bowl of cereal,
added a quarter cup of milk...

4
00:00:11,863 --> 00:00:16,573
...sat on this end of this couch, turned on
BBC America, and watched Doctor Who.

5
00:00:17,368 --> 00:00:18,448
(Leonard:)Penny's still sleeping.

6
00:00:20,079 --> 00:00:22,539
Every Saturday
since we've lived in this apartment...

7
00:00:22,707 --> 00:00:24,667
...I have awakened at 6:15,
poured myself...

8
00:00:24,834 --> 00:00:26,964
(Penny:)I know.
Look, you have a TV in your room.

9
00:00:27,128 --> 00:00:28,798
Why don't you have breakfast in bed?

10
00:00:29,213 --> 00:00:33,013
(Sheldon:)Because I am neither an invalid
nor a woman celebrating Mother's Day.

11
00:00:34,927 --> 00:00:36,177
(Penny:)What time is it?

12
00:00:36,596 --> 00:00:38,136
Almost 6:30.

13
00:00:38,306 --> 00:00:40,266
(Penny:)I slept all day?

14
00:00:40,892 --> 00:00:42,722
No, it's 6:30 in the morning.

15
00:00:43,436 --> 00:00:45,896
(Penny:)What the hell is your problem?

16
00:00:47,065 --> 00:00:49,565
(Sheldon:)Okay, this cereal
has lost all its molecular integrity.

17
00:00:49,734 --> 00:00:53,024
(Sheldon:)I now have a bowl
of shredded wheat paste.

